{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7221402,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221402,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":722140217,"next_line_ids":[722140218],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":1513065402,"text":"你为什么不回鸣神岛吃一顿？","raw_text":"你为什么不回鸣神岛吃一顿？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221402.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7221402,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221402,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":722140218,"next_line_ids":[722140219],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":417594354,"text":"一方面是太远了，另一方面…我雕刻的手感正好，要是去鸣神岛的话…这一来一回的，手感说不定就没了。","raw_text":"一方面是太远了，另一方面…我雕刻的手感正好，要是去鸣神岛的话…这一来一回的，手感说不定就没了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221402.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7221402,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221402,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":722140219,"next_line_ids":[722140220],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":3074118386,"text":"我还是就在这里迅速吃一顿，然后继续回去雕刻吧。","raw_text":"我还是就在这里迅速吃一顿，然后继续回去雕刻吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221402.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7221402,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221402,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":722140205,"next_line_ids":[722140206],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":3445381978,"text":"雕像比寝子大很多。","raw_text":"雕像比寝子大很多。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221402.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7221402,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221402,"sequence":19,"variant":0,"line_id":722140206,"next_line_ids":[722140207],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":753347402,"text":"那是当然啦，虽然代宫司大人比一般的猫也大很多…但是想要有气势的话，雕像的尺寸还得再进一步放大，毕竟是摆在神社里的雕像嘛。","raw_text":"那是当然啦，虽然代宫司大人比一般的猫也大很多…但是想要有气势的话，雕像的尺寸还得再进一步放大，毕竟是摆在神社里的雕像嘛。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221402.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7221403,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221403,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":722140301,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":2623772506,"text":"怎么样，你们拿到兽肉了吗？","raw_text":"怎么样，你们拿到兽肉了吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221403.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":7221404,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221404,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":722140401,"next_line_ids":[722140402],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":508302850,"text":"喔！这兽肉的品质…太感谢你们了！","raw_text":"喔！这兽肉的品质…太感谢你们了！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221404.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":7221404,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221404,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":722140402,"next_line_ids":[722140403],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":2131208130,"text":"我等会就去好好做几道好菜！吃了这些肉，我肯定能雕得更快一点！","raw_text":"我等会就去好好做几道好菜！吃了这些肉，我肯定能雕得更快一点！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221404.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":7221404,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221404,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":722140403,"next_line_ids":[722140404],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":3509662570,"text":"这两件事之间有关系吗？","raw_text":"这两件事之间有关系吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221404.json"}
