{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72214","main_id":72214,"main_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","main_description":"「浅濑神社代宫司」寝子似乎有事找你…","chapter_title":"寝子是只猫·神社食堂","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":7221404,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7221404,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":722140406,"next_line_ids":[722140407],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":1487176682,"text":"毕竟是为人…呃，为猫工作嘛，延期这种事，能避免最好还是避免吧。","raw_text":"毕竟是为人…呃，为猫工作嘛，延期这种事，能避免最好还是避免吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7221404.json"}
